{"id":"pattern-example-001","type":"pattern","fact":"Example: Use mock factories for all test data instead of manual mock objects with 'as Type' assertions.","recommendation":"Create centralized mock factory functions (createMockUser, createMockOrg, etc.) and import them in tests.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"documentation","reference":"Testing guide","date":"2026-01-09"}],"tags":["testing","mocks","factories"],"affectedFiles":["**/*.test.ts"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"pattern-value-equality-json-pin","type":"pattern","fact":"Asserting `A.decode body \\`shouldBe\\` Just (A.object [\"name\" .= (\"alpha\" :: Text)])` pins an entire JSON response shape \u2014 key names, nulls, nesting \u2014 in one line, with no field-by-field helper.","recommendation":"Use A.Value equality for wire-shape pins (new endpoints, request bodies); fall back to field lookups only when the object legitimately carries volatile members such as ids or timestamps.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"PR #283 (chat slash-command parity)","date":"2026-10-26"}],"tags":["testing","aeson","api"],"affectedFiles":["test/**/*.hs"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-26T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-26T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"pattern-route-every-effect-through-config-seam","type":"pattern","fact":"A chat-channel loop/handler that calls a transport function directly (startWsClient, httpNewSession) instead of its ChatChannelConfig seat cannot be tested without a real socket \u2014 and dialling it per test costs the full connect timeout (8 tests = 35s).","recommendation":"Route every effect through the config seam (cccStartWs, cccNewSession, \u2026) with the direct call as the production default, so production wiring is unchanged and tests stay instant.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"PR #283 (chat slash-command parity)","date":"2026-10-26"}],"tags":["chat-channels","testability","seams"],"affectedFiles":["src-chat-channels/Seal/Channels/Chat/Loop.hs"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-26T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-26T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
